Critical analysis of the interplay between breakpoints:

**The `@media (max-width: 960px)` responsive block** handles hero/grid collapsing — unrelated to nav. Pre-existing, not nav-related. Not a bug.

**BUT — `@media (max-width: 640px)` block, look at this:**
```css
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .nav-inner { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 18px; padding: 12px 18px; }
  .brand-sub { display: none; }
  .nav-links { margin-left: 0; order: 3; width: 100%; }
